TVLWeightedContainers::Constructor()
├── when epochDuration is zero
│   └── it should revert
├── given invalid initial containers
│   ├── when growthRate min is greater than max
│   │   └── it should revert
│   ├── when growthRate min is zero
│   │   └── it should revert
│   ├── when growthRate max is zero
│   │   └── it should revert
│   ├── when decayRate min is greater than max
│   │   └── it should revert
│   ├── when decayRate min is zero
│   │   └── it should revert
│   ├── when decayRate max is zero
│   │   └── it should revert
│   ├── when duration min is greater than max
│   │   └── it should revert
│   ├── when duration min is zero
│   │   └── it should revert
│   ├── when duration max is zero
│   │   └── it should revert
│   ├── when maxRateDifferenceEpochs is greater than duration max
│   │   └── it should revert
│   ├── when maxRateDifferenceEpochs is zero
│   │   └── it should revert
│   ├── when currentDurationEpochs is not zero
│   │   └── it should revert
│   └── when isActive is true
│       └── it should revert
└── given valid inputs
    ├── when no initial containers provided
    │   ├── it should set EPOCH_DURATION
    │   ├── it should set initializedAtTimestamp to zero
    │   ├── it should set nextEpochToProcess to zero
    │   ├── it should set totalContainerCount to zero
    │   └── it should emit EpochDurationSet event
    └── when valid initial containers provided
        ├── it should set EPOCH_DURATION
        ├── it should add all containers with correct IDs starting from 1
        ├── it should set container currentDurationEpochs to duration min
        ├── it should set container isActive to false
        ├── it should increment totalContainerCount for each container
        ├── it should emit EpochDurationSet event
        └── it should emit ContainerAdded event for each container 